factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the 48-ward, 4-zone figures describe where roads were damaged, but the article only says the roads in those 48 wards in 4 zones were damaged by water stagnation. This is a near-accurate paraphrase, so this is not a real error and can be ignored.
  The reel_script states that the work is 'இரவு பகலாக' (day and night) across all listed places, which the article only says for the 145-location repairs in general; minor, but the phrasing is acceptable.
  The reel_script lists 'திருமுல்லைவாயல் மணிகண்டபுரம், கோவில்பதாகை, அண்ணனூர் 60 அடி சாலை உட்பட இடங்களில் பணி நடைபெறுகிறது' and the caption says the 40,000 sq ft road repair is 'இரவு பகலாக' at those places, but the article ties the Rs. 40 lakh / 40,000 sq ft figures to the 145 locations collectively, not to the named places specifically; the caption wrongly attributes these numbers to the listed locations only.
  The slides_spec loc field and the caption 'ஆவடி, சென்னை மாவட்டம்' adds 'சென்னை மாவட்டம்' (Chennai district), which is not stated in the article.
